{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2022-04-12 10:02:00', 'title': 'HARRIS WILLIAMS ADVISES SOUTHWIRE COMPANY, LLC ON ITS ACQUISITION OF NOVINIUM, INC.', 'text': "RICHMOND, VA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HARRIS WILLIAMS, A GLOBAL INVESTMENT BANK SPECIALIZING IN M&A ADVISORY SERVICES, ANNOUNCES IT ADVISED SOUTHWIRE COMPANY, LLC (SOUTHWIRE), ONE OF NORTH AMERICA'S LARGEST WIRE AND CABLE PRODUCERS AND AN EMERGING INFLUENCE IN THE INDUSTRIAL ELECTRICAL SPACE, ON ITS ACQUISITION OF NOVINIUM, INC. (NOVINIUM), A CABLE REJUVENATION SOLUTIONS PROVIDER FOCUSED ON ELECTRIC UTILITIES. THE TRANSACTION WAS LED BY DREW SPITZER, MATT WHITE AND THOMAS SAUNDERS OF THE HARRIS W"}